I am near the door.
A new key is in my hand.
I place the key in the lock.
I slowly open the lock.
Asha is near me.
She is happy.
I open the door.
I go inside.
I look everywhere in the main room.
There is good light in the room.
This home is not empty.
There is new furniture here.
There is a large sofa there.
Nearby there is a table.
Above, there is a fan.
Below, there is a beautiful carpet.
A flower vase is placed on the table.
Everything is placed nicely.
This is my real home in Mumbai.
I am very happy.
